Actually, looking at this more carefully, the three formatters have legitimately different purposes:
• format_duration — millisecond precision for cost/timing display ("1.5s", "2m 30s")
• `format_duration_live` — whole-second display for live spinners ("5s", "2m 30s")
• format_elapsed — compact no-space format for bg jobs ("2m30s")

